"tr":"nayantōḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நயந்","tr":"nayan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோள்","tr":"tōḷ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கோடீர்","parts":[{"text":"கோடு","lemma":"கோடு","gloss":"conch shell"},{"text":"ஈர்","lemma":"ஈர்","gloss":"sliced"}],"gloss":"sliced conch shell"},{"surface":"இலங்குவளை","parts":[{"text":"இலங்கு","lemma":"இலங்கு","gloss":"shining"},{"text":"வளை","lemma":"வளை","gloss":"bangle"}],"gloss":"shining bangles"},{"surface":"நெகிழ","parts":[{"text":"நெகிழ்","lemma":"நெகிழ்","gloss":"slip/loosen"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to slip off"},{"surface":"நாளும்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"every day"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாடில","parts":[{"text":"பாடு","lemma":"பாடு","gloss":"ceasing/rest"},{"text":"இல","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without rest"},{"surface":"கலிழ்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"கலிழ்ந்து","lemma":"கலிழ்","gloss":"weeping"}],"gloss":"weeping"},{"surface":"பனி","parts":[{"text":"பனி","lemma":"பனி","gloss":"tears"}],"gloss":"tears"},{"surface":"ஆனாவே","parts":[{"text":"ஆனா","lemma":"ஆனா","gloss":"not ceasing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed do not cease"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துன்னரும்","parts":[{"text":"துன்னு","lemma":"துன்னு","gloss":"approach"},{"text":"அரும்","lemma":"அருமை","gloss":"difficult"}],"gloss":"difficult to approach"},{"surface":"நெடுவரை","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"tall"},{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"tall mountain"},{"surface":"ததும்பிய","parts":[{"text":"ததும்பு","lemma":"ததும்பு","gloss":"gush/roar"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"இய","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"roaring/gushing"},{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"அருவி","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"waterfall"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தன்ணென்","parts":[{"text":"தன்ணென்","lemma":"தண்ணென்","gloss":"cool-sounding"}],"gloss":"cool-sounding"},{"surface":"முரசின்","parts":[{"text":"முரசின்","lemma":"முரசு","gloss":"drum"}],"gloss":"of the drum"},{"surface":"இமிழிசை","parts":[{"text":"இமிழிசை","lemma":"இமிழிசை","gloss":"roaring sound"}],"gloss":"roaring sound"},{"surface":"காட்டும்","parts":[{"text":"காட்டும்","lemma":"காட்டு","gloss":"shows/resembles"}],"gloss":"resembles"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மருங்கின்","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கு","lemma":"மருங்கு","gloss":"side/slope"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"on the slopes"},{"surface":"கொண்ட","parts":[{"text":"கொண்ட","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"பலவின்","parts":[{"text":"பலவு","lemma":"பலவு","gloss":"jackfruit tree"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique suffix"}],"gloss":"of the jackfruit tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"great"},{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"mountain/stone"}],"gloss":"great mountain"},{"surface":"நாட","parts":[{"text":"நாட","lemma":"நாடன்","gloss":"O lord of the land"}],"gloss":"O lord of the land"},{"surface":"நீ","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you"},{"surface":"நயந்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"நயந்தோள்","lemma":"நயந்தோள்","gloss":"she whom you desired"}],"gloss":"she whom you desired"},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்ணே","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eyes/place"}],"gloss":"eyes / in the eyes of"}]}],"literal":"Sliced conch-shell shining bangles to slip off, every day, / without rest, weeping, tears indeed do not cease, / on the difficult-to-approach tall mountain, the roaring waterfall / resembles the cool-sounding drum's roaring sound, / on the slopes having jackfruit trees, / O lord of the great mountain land! In the eyes of her whom you desired.","translation":"O lord of the great mountain land, where on the slopes filled with jackfruit trees, the roaring waterfall of the difficult-to-reach high peaks sounds like a cool, deep-voiced drum! In the eyes of the woman you desired, tears never cease to flow without rest, and she weeps every day, making her sliced conch-shell bangles slip from her arms.","modern":"பலா மரங்களைக் கொண்ட பக்கமலைகளில், அணுக முடியாத உயர்ந்த மலையிலிருந்து ஆரவாரித்து விழும் அருவியானது, குளிர்ந்த ஓசையுடைய முரசின் முழக்கத்தைப் போன்ற ஒலியை எழுப்பும் பெரிய மலைநாட்டிற்கு உரியவனே! நீ விரும்பிய தலைவியின் கண்களிலிருந்து, அவளுடைய வெட்டப்பட்ட சங்கு வளையல்கள் கழன்று வீழுமாறு, நாள்தோறும் ஓய்வில்லாமல் அழுது வடியும் கண்ணீர் நின்றபாடில்லை.","explanation":"This poem is set in the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape, where the theme is the secret union and the subsequent pining of the heroine. The speaker is the heroine's friend (thozhi), addressing the hero (the lord of the mountain land) who has been delaying his public marriage. She describes how the heroine's eyes are constantly filled with tears, causing her to lose weight and her bangles to slip off. The friend uses a vivid description of the mountain: the roaring waterfall on the slopes of the jackfruit trees sounds like a royal drum. This image of the loud drum-like waterfall suggests that the hero's secret visits are becoming public knowledge, like a drumbeat, and urges him to marry her soon to end her sorrow. Key words include \"வளை நெகிழ\" (bangles slipping), \"பனியா னாவே\" (tears do not cease), and \"நாட\" (O lord of the land).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}